RENDERFROST SMP WEBSITE

HOSTING QUICK START

1. Extract this ZIP file.
2. Upload the contents of the extracted folder to the root of your static website.
3. Keep the nine HTML files at the root and preserve the complete assets folder.
4. Set 404.html as the host's custom not-found page.
5. Enable HTTPS, then test the website on desktop and mobile.

This is a static website. No server runtime, database, setup command, credentials,
or secrets are needed. Netlify reads the included _headers file; other hosts may
require you to configure response headers and the 404 page in their settings.

Read "Deployment guide.md" for full setup, domain/SEO notes, cache behavior, and
troubleshooting. The public website domain is not confirmed, so replace no example
domain with a guess. Do not mistake the Minecraft server address for the website
domain.

